    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="920a50f4-6314-5f59-8faf-8bea01c10873" activityNameId="e2852e46-f65b-5774-9b90-3f1936a43421" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx 3-methyl-1-butyl acetate, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx 3-methyl-1-butyl acetate, at plant
The process "3-methyl-1-butyl acetate, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of 3-methyl-1-butyl acetate from 3-methyl-1-butanol in Europe. Raw materials are modelled with a stoechiometric calculation.  Energy consumptions are modelled with data from a similar process. The emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000123-92-2; 
Formula: C7H14O2; 
Synonyms: isopentyl acetate; 
UUID: b0c01332-d778-3f14-89d5-2166fec8c294
Production of 3-methyl-1-butyl acetate including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Esterification of 3-methyl-1-butanol
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports and emissions are modelled with standard methods.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_b0c01332-d778-3f14-89d5-2166fec8c294.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
